      "content": "thanks. that helps. i'm just noticing a pattern though... the timing of the transit strike right as they're pushing these zoning changes for the downtown corridor feels a bit too convenient to be coincidence. it's like they're trying to keep everyone looking at the infrastructure chaos so no one notices the actual restructuring of the district. do you see how i can frame a question about the \"coincidence\" of the timing in a way that sounds like i'm just a concerned citizen, but actually flags the pattern for someone who knows what to look for?",
